1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:08,000
Wie ist es der Gemeinschaft des Kibbutz gelungen, wieder Halt zu finden?

2
00:00:10,600 --> 00:00:12,466
we know this very well already,

3
00:00:12,466 --> 00:00:15,366
because it’s not our first attack unfortunately...

4
