and you just get out of the kibbutz.

26
00:01:20,500 --> 00:01:20,800
Now...

27
00:01:20,800 --> 00:01:24,666
there were so many situations in which I found myself,

28
00:01:24,666 --> 00:01:27,766
3am walking with my...

29
