66
00:03:14,266 --> 00:03:17,700
one of my neighbors' in another hand running to shelter,

67
00:03:18,100 --> 00:03:21,766
and I think that knowing...

68
00:03:23,533 --> 00:03:28,933
I think that this community lives according to values,

69
00:03:28,933 --> 00:03:31,333
that in many parts of the world are long,

70
